DESCRIPTION:Feeds /cheltenham-earnings-history and /cheltenham-house-prices
 /affordability through earnings.py and affordability.py in the monthly wor
 kflow. Run the monthly workflow by hand afterwards so the housing squeeze 
 draft can add 2026 pay to its rent share chart (rebuild cheltenham-rent-sh
 are-of-pay with --force).\n\nhttps://www.gov.uk/government/statistics/anno
 uncements/employee-earnings-in-the-uk-2026
