UID:20261126-refresh-the-housing-squeeze-draft@cheltenham-od.uk
DTSTAMP:20261009T130738Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261126T093000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261126T100000
SUMMARY:[Expected] Housing supply figures and housing squeeze post
DESCRIPTION:Provisional release day (late-November Thursday\; confirm on GO
 V.UK). The housing squeeze draft publishes today at 11:30. After the relea
 se: run housing-supply.py (or the monthly workflow by hand)\, then build-f
 indings.py cheltenham-housing-supply-slowdown --force and update the avera
 ges. If not done since 22 October\, also rebuild cheltenham-rent-share-of-
 pay with --force for 2026 pay. Then move the draft from _drafts to _posts 
 and commit.\n\nhttps://www.gov.uk/government/statistics/announcements/hous
 ing-supply-net-additional-dwellings-england-2025-to-2026
URL:https://www.gov.uk/government/statistics/announcements/housing-supply-n
 et-additional-dwellings-england-2025-to-2026
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
